  <item>
    <title>자판기 칸이 모자랄 때, 보조자판기를 이어 붙이세요</title>
    <link>https://phenomenal-lamington-f68def.netlify.app/post/2026-10-07-%EB%B3%B4%EC%A1%B0%EC%9E%90%ED%8C%90%EA%B8%B0-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0%EB%A1%9C-%EC%B9%B8-%EB%8A%98%EB%A6%AC%EA%B8%B0</link>
